sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor dev as Developer
  participant cmd as release-public command
  participant build as build/build.py (yours)
  participant dist as dist/public
  dev->>cmd: /agent-ops-kit:release-public
  cmd->>build: python3 build/build.py public
  alt deny patterns survive
    build-->>cmd: nonzero exit, no dist/public written
    cmd-->>dev: report findings and stop
  else clean build
    build->>dist: write public tree
    cmd->>dist: list files, read README, check placeholders, LICENSE, SECURITY.md
    cmd-->>dev: PENDING: publish, awaiting your authorization
  end
